Modified by Praxen Development & Engineering (https://github.com/clduab11),
from July 2026 and ongoing. The git history of this repository is the
complete, dated record of the modifications. The larger changes include:

  - Private self-hosted deployment as a docker compose stack, replacing
    the upstream hosted topology (Vercel / Railway / Upstash / Convex).
  - Rebranding to "the-synactic"; the in-app footer retains the upstream
    credit ("forked from World Monitor").
  - A trader variant carrying individually licensed venue market data
    (Kraken), read-only by charter.
  - A DEFCON OSINT readiness indicator (data by defconlevel.com).
  - Local model integration (LM Studio) for LLM synthesis and a local
    embedding/vector-search layer.
  - An expanded MCP tool surface and agent-skills directory.
  - Verification and hardening work throughout (contract truthing,
    provenance labeling, fail-loud degradation states).

Upstream components remain under their original licenses. The upstream
README is preserved verbatim as UPSTREAM-WORLDMONITOR-README.md.
